      "title": "Source",
      "type": "string"
     },
     "why_it_matters": {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "type": "string"
     },
     "closest_read": {
      "description": "读过的论文里离这个空白最近的，最多 3 篇；没有就留空",
      "items": {
